WEBVTT

00:01:40.910 --> 00:01:45.910
<i></i>To My

00:01:40.910 --> 00:01:45.910
<i></i>Dear Friend...

00:01:47.540 --> 00:01:52.040
It has been a while. How are you?

00:01:52.040 --> 00:01:55.620
I'm sorry I never had a chance to write to you.

00:01:55.620 --> 00:02:01.120
We are currently in the Ogria Mountain,
receiving hospitality from the Orcs.

00:02:02.290 --> 00:02:09.160
A lot of things happened until now.
Really, a lot of things...

00:02:09.160 --> 00:02:15.660
Kasel got a lot stronger
and is currently in a battle.

00:02:15.660 --> 00:02:17.620
He is fighting himself...

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:24.540
Back when I was in Orvelia, I didn't even
imagine these things could happen.

00:02:24.540 --> 00:02:31.540
But, Clause... I think this was
our destiny all along.

00:02:31.540 --> 00:02:37.910
Kasel was destined to live
as the heir to the Holy Sword.

00:02:38.950 --> 00:02:41.700
After parting ways with you
at the Tower of the Sage,

00:02:41.700 --> 00:02:45.990
we headed out to the Forest
of Elidora, to see the elves.

00:02:45.990 --> 00:02:51.490
It was the first step in a very tough journey...

00:03:19.330 --> 00:03:21.950
But anyway, who are you?

00:03:21.950 --> 00:03:24.620
You didn't even introduce yourself,
and you're all like, "Follow me."

00:03:24.620 --> 00:03:27.410
Kind of rude, don't you think?

00:03:27.410 --> 00:03:28.990
I am Selene.

00:03:28.990 --> 00:03:34.410
Master Lorraine instructed me
to bring to her the human, Kasel.

00:03:38.240 --> 00:03:40.240
Huh?

00:03:40.240 --> 00:03:41.740
Where's Miss Selene?

00:03:41.740 --> 00:03:44.160
She was just here a moment ago...

00:03:44.160 --> 00:03:46.950
We have to catch up to her quickly.

00:03:54.120 --> 00:03:56.540
It's a dead end!

00:03:56.540 --> 00:03:58.540
What?!

00:03:58.540 --> 00:04:00.410
By the way...

00:04:00.410 --> 00:04:04.200
Do you know the other name
for the Forest of Elidora?

00:04:04.200 --> 00:04:05.240
No.

00:04:05.240 --> 00:04:06.700
Forest of the Lost.

00:04:06.700 --> 00:04:11.290
The elves and treants play tricks on
travelers to make them lose their way.

00:04:11.290 --> 00:04:14.120
You're telling us this now?!

00:04:27.120 --> 00:04:28.950
He has grown fond of you.

00:04:28.950 --> 00:04:30.120
Huh?

00:04:31.490 --> 00:04:37.950
Perhaps Necha sees something
completely different in you...

00:04:39.620 --> 00:04:45.950
Something only he sees, that we cannot see...

00:04:50.910 --> 00:04:54.490
Who are you?

00:05:01.290 --> 00:05:04.740
Nobody. I'm a nobody.

00:05:04.740 --> 00:05:10.910
I want to protect the people dear to me,
but I have no strength at all.

00:05:12.490 --> 00:05:17.580
That's why I have to meet Master
Lorraine, to gain that power.

00:05:25.040 --> 00:05:26.540
This...

00:05:28.580 --> 00:05:29.740
Huh?

00:05:41.910 --> 00:05:44.330
You...

00:05:44.330 --> 00:05:46.580
You! You!

00:05:46.580 --> 00:05:49.990
You!

00:05:53.830 --> 00:05:54.700
This thing!

00:05:54.700 --> 00:05:55.990
Kasel!

00:05:55.990 --> 00:05:57.990
Please stop!

00:06:08.040 --> 00:06:10.120
Master Lorraine...

00:06:15.040 --> 00:06:18.830
This one is the heir to the Holy Sword...?

00:06:18.830 --> 00:06:21.790
Unfortunately, I cannot unseal it
right this moment.

00:06:21.790 --> 00:06:26.080
I need the power, Master Lorraine!

00:06:26.080 --> 00:06:31.540
The power of the Holy Sword is so strong,
it can even defeat the Dark Lord.

00:06:31.540 --> 00:06:34.410
If it is not wielded properly...

00:06:34.410 --> 00:06:40.240
Kasel, it could destroy you, both body and soul.

00:06:40.240 --> 00:06:43.870
I don't care what happens to me...

00:06:43.870 --> 00:06:48.950
I need power! To protect those dear to me!

00:06:56.040 --> 00:07:01.620
Chibi... I'm so sorry I couldn't protect you.

00:07:01.620 --> 00:07:05.330
I did defeat that Demon...

00:07:05.330 --> 00:07:07.620
But...

00:07:07.620 --> 00:07:10.990
All I did was lose myself in anger.

00:07:10.990 --> 00:07:14.910
It was just dumb luck that the Demon
was defeated in the process.

00:07:14.910 --> 00:07:17.080
That's not the power I need.

00:07:17.080 --> 00:07:19.950
If this goes on, I...

00:07:22.330 --> 00:07:25.620
I want to be stronger...

00:07:32.040 --> 00:07:40.200
Until now, I believed humans were destroyers,
a threat to all lives in the forest.

00:07:40.200 --> 00:07:43.370
A selfish existence with no self-control.

00:07:43.370 --> 00:07:48.910
But Kasel here, and his companions,
rushed to help the Forest of Elidora

00:07:48.910 --> 00:07:53.240
the moment they saw the Demon,
with no regard for their own safety.

00:07:53.240 --> 00:07:57.990
Why weren't you able to answer me last night?

00:07:57.990 --> 00:08:03.870
When Kasel lost Necha, he appeared
to have lost control of himself.

00:08:03.870 --> 00:08:06.540
If a human like that gained power,

00:08:06.540 --> 00:08:10.700
he may use it against the Forest
of Elidora in the near future.

00:08:10.700 --> 00:08:13.410
That's what I feared.

00:08:13.410 --> 00:08:16.950
But no, he understood.

00:08:16.950 --> 00:08:23.080
He knew that what he felt then was not
true power. Yet, he still seeks power.

00:08:23.080 --> 00:08:30.080
Master Lorraine, I think Kasel is worthy
of inheriting the power of the Holy Sword.

00:08:32.290 --> 00:08:37.160
Now, I will undo the seal on the Holy Sword Aea.

00:08:56.740 --> 00:09:00.580
There are two more locks on this seal.

00:09:00.580 --> 00:09:06.540
One is with Aeatola, the leader of
the Orcs in the Ogria Mountain...

00:09:06.540 --> 00:09:10.040
And the other is with Pavel,
in the Windland Snow Mountain,

00:09:10.040 --> 00:09:13.660
that is even further away than Ogria Mountain.

00:09:15.490 --> 00:09:18.290
Visit these two.

00:09:20.990 --> 00:09:28.450
Back then, we didn't really understand what
it meant to gain the power of the Holy Sword.

00:09:28.450 --> 00:09:34.740
We had no idea what would happen
to Kasel once he got that power.

00:09:34.740 --> 00:09:37.040
How is Kasel doing?

00:09:37.910 --> 00:09:41.870
His fever has gone down mostly,
but he's still unconscious.

00:09:41.870 --> 00:09:48.790
I see. But Mr. Kaulah said he's not in
any real danger, right? He'll be fine.

00:09:51.040 --> 00:09:52.620
Were you writing a letter?

00:09:52.620 --> 00:09:57.200
Yes. I thought I should let Clause
know how we're doing.

00:09:57.200 --> 00:10:01.950
That's a good idea!
I should write a letter to Dominix.

00:10:01.950 --> 00:10:04.290
What should I write about?

00:10:04.290 --> 00:10:09.410
About how I, a genius sorceress,
defeated Demons to save a village?

00:10:09.410 --> 00:10:12.200
How I burned an evil dragon to a crisp?

00:10:12.200 --> 00:10:15.240
Dragon...? Have you ever even seen one before?

00:10:15.240 --> 00:10:19.740
I do recall you burning an inn's
kitchen to a crisp, though.

00:10:19.740 --> 00:10:22.490
D-Don't dwell on the details!

00:10:22.490 --> 00:10:24.200
Lying isn't great either.

00:10:24.200 --> 00:10:26.660
Come on, don't take it that way.

00:10:26.660 --> 00:10:29.120
It's just a little imaginative exaggeration.

00:10:29.120 --> 00:10:30.740
Little...?

00:10:30.740 --> 00:10:34.240
Dear Master Dominix. What's up?

00:10:34.240 --> 00:10:38.830
My journey with this merry
gang is still ongoing.

00:10:43.830 --> 00:10:48.700
Master Lorraine, the Demons that entered
the forest have been dealt with.

00:10:48.700 --> 00:10:52.740
I see. Thank you for the hard work, Selene.

00:10:52.740 --> 00:10:55.950
The Day of Lea, the Goddess
of Darkness, approaches.

00:10:55.950 --> 00:11:02.990
If the Dark Lord Angmund appears again,
Demons may invade the whole world.

00:11:02.990 --> 00:11:05.490
I wonder how Kasel is doing.

00:11:05.490 --> 00:11:11.080
He should be past Ogria Mountain
by now, on his way to meet Pavel.

00:11:11.080 --> 00:11:13.290
I hope they're all right.

00:11:13.290 --> 00:11:17.660
I'm sure they are fine...

00:11:17.660 --> 00:11:26.120
Clause, during our trip, I learned that
the world is a lot bigger than I thought.

00:11:26.120 --> 00:11:30.410
I would never have known that
if I had stayed in Orvelia.

00:11:30.410 --> 00:11:35.410
The Demonic threat is all over the world now...

00:11:35.410 --> 00:11:40.160
Everyone is living their lives to the best
of their abilities in these trying times.

00:11:40.160 --> 00:11:42.950
Madam Volf is one of them.

00:11:45.160 --> 00:11:48.580
This might just be a bare land right now,

00:11:48.580 --> 00:11:52.620
but it used to be a town full of travelers.

00:11:52.620 --> 00:11:56.870
But one day, the war came.

00:11:56.870 --> 00:12:01.950
People, houses, chaos, fighting...
They all burned down.

00:12:01.950 --> 00:12:05.120
Including my family.

00:12:05.990 --> 00:12:09.450
The only fire you can use here is charcoal.

00:12:32.120 --> 00:12:35.040
Cleo! Use your magic!

00:12:35.040 --> 00:12:37.910
The present is more precious than the past!

00:12:37.910 --> 00:12:39.870
You have to live!

00:12:47.290 --> 00:12:50.790
Use your magic, save your friends!

00:13:16.660 --> 00:13:20.830
Elise, a girl we met in a small village,

00:13:20.830 --> 00:13:24.370
was doing her best despite
the loneliness and sadness.

00:13:25.450 --> 00:13:26.740
Hello there.

00:13:26.740 --> 00:13:29.370
We met at the forest earlier.

00:13:38.200 --> 00:13:42.660
That girl is Elise.
She doesn't talk at all or laugh.

00:13:42.660 --> 00:13:46.370
I see. What about her parents?

00:13:46.370 --> 00:13:50.870
I don't know the details.
They're not here, though.

00:13:50.870 --> 00:13:52.580
Which must mean...

00:13:55.370 --> 00:13:58.290
Let's all draw some pictures
and put them up all over.

00:13:58.290 --> 00:14:01.580
That should brighten up the place!

00:14:14.870 --> 00:14:16.660
Let me borrow that for a second.

00:14:16.660 --> 00:14:17.790
No!

00:14:17.790 --> 00:14:19.120
Ouch.

00:14:20.830 --> 00:14:23.200
Are you all right?

00:14:24.990 --> 00:14:29.240
Elise, that was hurtful.

00:14:37.370 --> 00:14:39.120
What's wrong?

00:14:40.620 --> 00:14:44.620
Is this... Is this what you
were drawing earlier?

00:14:44.620 --> 00:14:47.740
Is this your favorite flower, Elise?

00:14:48.620 --> 00:14:51.540
Mom... Liked these...

00:14:51.540 --> 00:14:52.990
Mom?

00:14:54.200 --> 00:14:55.740
Demons...

00:14:57.120 --> 00:15:00.580
Demons... My mom...

00:15:20.740 --> 00:15:24.790
I'm sorry, can we help a little?

00:15:24.790 --> 00:15:28.330
Oh? What will you help us with?

00:15:28.330 --> 00:15:29.330
This.

00:15:29.330 --> 00:15:32.490
We'd like to make snacks out of these flowers.

00:15:32.490 --> 00:15:33.740
Huh?

00:15:51.160 --> 00:15:53.990
Elise helped me out; she worked very hard.

00:15:53.990 --> 00:15:55.450
Wow!

00:15:58.120 --> 00:16:03.910
Elise, you can do this, right?
You've learned the recipe, right?

00:16:03.910 --> 00:16:05.370
Yes!

00:16:11.240 --> 00:16:14.830
So what are these "undead" anyway?

00:16:14.830 --> 00:16:20.120
He mentioned that the people who
were killed by the Demons came back.

00:16:20.120 --> 00:16:24.540
Dead people coming back
to life? Is that possible?

00:16:24.540 --> 00:16:29.290
The undead are moving corpses.
They never come back to life.

00:16:29.290 --> 00:16:31.660
Moving corpses...?

00:16:31.660 --> 00:16:36.990
There are instances of dead people
rising up and attacking the living

00:16:36.990 --> 00:16:40.410
mentioned in the records of the Battle
of Galluah Plains 100 years ago.

00:16:40.410 --> 00:16:44.240
It's said that the Demons control the undead.

00:16:48.410 --> 00:16:50.080
I...

00:16:52.700 --> 00:16:55.620
...will protect everyone!

00:16:59.450 --> 00:17:06.740
We finally reached Ogria Mountain,
but the Demons were already there.

00:17:10.620 --> 00:17:12.200
Humans?!

00:17:15.580 --> 00:17:18.950
Scorched black, coming right up!

00:17:27.160 --> 00:17:34.330
I occasionally receive messages from
the great ancestral spirits as dreams.

00:17:34.330 --> 00:17:36.450
A prophetic dream, if you will.

00:17:36.450 --> 00:17:38.160
I've heard about that.

00:17:38.160 --> 00:17:43.910
Orc shamans can lead their tribe
to a better future through dreams.

00:17:43.910 --> 00:17:51.290
Yes. A human hero will appear in a
chaotic future and bring hope to us all.

00:17:53.950 --> 00:17:57.790
I will unlock the seal. Are you ready?

00:17:57.790 --> 00:17:59.080
Yes!

00:18:10.330 --> 00:18:14.200
What? What is this power?

00:18:14.200 --> 00:18:16.200
Could it be...?

00:18:16.200 --> 00:18:20.290
Fight in a way befitting the
honor of the Holy Sword.

00:18:20.290 --> 00:18:21.200
Yes!

00:18:21.200 --> 00:18:26.120
Kasel, friends, I wish you good luck.

00:18:30.950 --> 00:18:35.330
He's the human that gave our
friends to the Demons...?

00:18:38.740 --> 00:18:43.370
"Human"? Don't equate me
with such lowly creatures.

00:18:43.370 --> 00:18:49.950
It is I! I, Malduk, am the one that has
created the undead and sent them back!

00:18:52.830 --> 00:18:58.490
Malduk?! The same Malduk that brought
in the Dark Lord 100 years ago?

00:18:58.490 --> 00:19:00.240
I'll get him...!

00:19:00.240 --> 00:19:01.870
I'll take him down!

00:19:08.330 --> 00:19:10.080
My...

00:19:10.080 --> 00:19:13.080
My hair!

00:19:16.990 --> 00:19:18.200
Frey!

00:19:36.290 --> 00:19:37.830
This is...

00:19:46.410 --> 00:19:48.120
Kasel!

00:19:48.120 --> 00:19:49.740
Come on!

00:19:50.660 --> 00:19:55.830
Kasel tried to protect us,
but his emotions were too strong...

00:19:55.830 --> 00:19:59.120
I think that's what caused him
to lose control of his power.

00:20:00.580 --> 00:20:04.620
The Orcs now praise Kasel as a true hero.

00:20:04.620 --> 00:20:09.910
Every time they say so, though, it pains me,
like someone is squeezing my heart.

00:20:09.910 --> 00:20:14.040
A hero protects everyone, but...

00:20:14.040 --> 00:20:19.040
Clause, who protects the hero?

00:20:20.490 --> 00:20:22.990
Done! A masterpiece!

00:20:22.990 --> 00:20:24.790
What's wrong, Frey?

00:20:24.790 --> 00:20:27.080
Um... It's nothing.

00:20:27.080 --> 00:20:29.660
Are you unsure what to write?

00:20:29.660 --> 00:20:31.330
No, it's just that...

00:20:31.330 --> 00:20:35.410
I was remembering the things
that happened in our journey.

00:20:35.410 --> 00:20:40.990
And also, I'm thinking about what
a huge destiny Kasel is carrying now.

00:20:40.990 --> 00:20:43.450
It's a little hard for me.

00:20:43.450 --> 00:20:47.490
Yeah, only the Holy Sword
can beat the Dark Lord.

00:20:47.490 --> 00:20:51.450
Kasel has the fate of the
whole world riding on him.

00:20:51.450 --> 00:20:55.910
But... that's what we're here for, right?!

00:20:55.910 --> 00:20:59.700
Sure, I worry about Kasel, too.

00:20:59.700 --> 00:21:04.490
But if we get all negative about it,
we won't be able to support Kasel.

00:21:04.490 --> 00:21:06.040
Cleo...

00:21:06.040 --> 00:21:12.620
Also, you might think I'm
too optimistic, but I believe.

00:21:12.620 --> 00:21:17.950
I believe Kasel will wake up.
I believe we'll get the Holy Sword.

00:21:17.950 --> 00:21:21.080
Probably because I'm with you all.

00:21:21.080 --> 00:21:25.870
You make me believe nothing is impossible,
and we that can do anything.

00:21:25.870 --> 00:21:28.040
Cool, huh?

00:21:28.040 --> 00:21:31.620
Me, too. Being with you give me energy.

00:21:31.620 --> 00:21:32.950
Huh? Really?

00:21:32.950 --> 00:21:36.540
Yes! I can do anything!

00:21:36.540 --> 00:21:44.540
I'm so happy you feel that way!
I get energy when I'm around you, too!

00:21:44.540 --> 00:21:48.620
Does that mean our love is mutual?!

00:21:51.450 --> 00:21:57.120
My dear friend Clause,
we are continuing on our journey.

00:21:57.120 --> 00:22:02.330
It's a harsh and difficult path,
but I have friends who support me.

00:22:02.330 --> 00:22:05.950
That's why I'll never give up.

00:22:05.950 --> 00:22:10.700
Until we meet again, please be well. Frey.

00:23:46.830 --> 00:23:51.870
As Kasel sleeps, the Guardian Knights of Orvelia

00:23:51.870 --> 00:23:55.450
head out to the Galluah Plains
to investigate the Demons.

00:23:55.450 --> 00:24:00.910
However, that was just an entrance
into despair and sadness...

00:23:58.450 --> 00:24:00.960
<i></i>The Entrance

00:23:58.450 --> 00:24:00.960
<i></i>to the Abyss
